<title>USA: N.Y. $55 mln taxable bonds repriced, coupons set.</title>
<headline>N.Y. $55 mln taxable bonds repriced, coupons set.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co said Wednesday it repriced New York State Environmental Facilities Corp's $54.8 million taxable bond deal, and set coupons on the issue.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>NEW YORK STATE</p>
<p>ENVIRONMENTAL FACILITIES CORPORATION</p>
<p>RE: $54,765,000</p>
<p>TAXABLE STATE SERVICE CONTRACT REVENUE BONDS,</p>
<p>SERIES 1997 A</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD</p>
<p>THE BONDS ARE TAXABLE MUNICIPAL SECURITIES AND THIS OFFERING</p>
<p>IS SUBJECT TO REGULATION BY MUNICIPAL SECURITIES RULE MAKING</p>
<p>BOARD.  ALL ACTIVITY UNDERTAKEN WITH RESPECT TO THIS OFFERING</p>
<p>MUST BE SUPERVISED BY A MUNICIPAL SECURITY PRINCIPAL.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Baa1		S&amp;P: BBB		   FITCH: A</p>
<p>    DATED: 02/15/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 09/15/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 09/15 &amp; 03/15</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
